# Chromosome Numbers and Evolution

=== layout: one-panel

# *Number of Chromosomes*

@body

- Mosquito\: 6
- Drosophila (fruit fly)\: 8
- Onion\: 16
- Cat, Pig\: 38
- Dolphin, Rabbit\: 44
- Humans\: 46
- Tobacco, Monkeys, Great Apes\: 48
- Dog, Chicken\: 78
- Carp\: 104

