# Summary

=== layout: bookend

# Key Takeaways

@body

- *Karyotypes*: condensed chromosomes in homologous pairs
- *Banding and probes*: chromosome identification
- *Centromere position*: chromosome shapes
- *HeLa cells*: chromosome variation, research, consent

